{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>正拍攝tvN新劇《UNNATURAL》的韓國女團少女時代成員Yoon A，昨晚現身首爾龍山區，出席珠寶品牌的宣傳活動，她以中短髮造型示人，穿上黑色Tube Dress大晒白滑香肩，散發優雅氣質，女團i-dle的台灣成員葉舒華與女星鄭素敏亦同樣身穿Tube Dress晒肩登場，同樣養眼，至於最近憑新劇《最後一桌》與觀眾見面的男星安孝燮就身穿黑色絲絨西裝，配襯上閃爆胸針，既高貴又型格。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:16:18.335527+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:48:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.514836+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:09:30.893516+00:00","content_hash":"0931562f02de47835a5e22b9430d36f884ee84bcc48473554a467e63422a6b0d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:16:18.335527+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}